  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "n1",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 200,
   "text": "The prior is a hand-built filter, not a learned module - so it costs nothing at inference\nand carries no dataset bias of its own. It is a strong hypothesis about where vessels are,",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "seed": 1015,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7105,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "The prior is a hand-built filter, not a learned module - so it costs nothing at inference\nand carries no dataset bias of its own. It is a strong hypothesis about where vessels are,",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "width": 1485.0000000000002,
   "height": 18.75
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "n2",
   "x": 60,
   "y": 250,
   "text": "and a poor segmenter on its own: clDice 0.284 at its best threshold, with the vessel tree\nshattered into roughly 4,900 components per image. The adapter is what turns one into the other.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "angle": 0,
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "seed": 1016,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 7112,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "and a poor segmenter on its own: clDice 0.284 at its best threshold, with the vessel tree\nshattered into roughly 4,900 components per image. The adapter is what turns one into the other.",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "width": 1534.5000000000002,
   "height": 18.75
  },
